            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "thanks selckin, there is a problem with IW#numDocs using a MERGE reader to get the deleted docs to calculate the num live docs. I will track this down if this is a more general problem.\n\nsimon",
